  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia II Compact - Agriculture Project: The Agriculture Policy Reform and Institutional Strengthening Project aims to improve institutional capacity to facilitate private sector production and trade in grains. It will enhance the public sector&#xfffd;s operational efficiency and its ability to develop and implement policies, regulations, and procedures conducive to private sector engagement while also strengthening ancillary market support institutions such as a commodity exchange and a reliable market information hub.</narrative>
  </description>
